Scope of this license

This license covers the Persian translations, scripts and documentation
written for this project. It does NOT cover:

- The original English game text included as lookup keys in the
  translation files. It belongs to its owners (Activision) and is included
  only so the translation can be matched at runtime.
- The runtime hook in files/ (trhook.dll, bink2w64.dll), taken from the
  Turkish MW4 patch (Turkce Yama). It belongs to its own authors and is
  included with credit for convenience.

This is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
Activision or Infinity Ward. "Call of Duty" and "Modern Warfare" are
trademarks of their respective owners.
